    <string name="no_ir_title">No IR camera found</string>
    <string name="no_ir_body">This phone either has no infrared camera, or its ROM hides it from apps. On the Poco F1 and Mi 8 the IR face-unlock camera is usually visible on AOSP-based ROMs and hidden on MIUI.</string>
    <string name="no_ir_cameras">Cameras this phone exposes</string>
    <string name="no_ir_none">No cameras are exposed at all.</string>
    <string name="no_ir_open">Open</string>
    <string name="no_ir_help">Why is it hidden?</string>
    <string name="no_ir_help_body">Many Qualcomm camera stacks only reveal auxiliary cameras to packages listed in the system property camera.aux.packagelist. Adding io.github.hrmasss.iris there (for example with a Magisk module that sets the prop) usually exposes the IR camera. Iris never edits system files itself.</string>
